namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamPassLayerComponent {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassLayerComponent.h#DreamPassLayerComponent
    src   "Gives the primitives of its actor pass layers, which a mesh pass selects with `Filter = Layer(Name)`.\n\nThe layers are the names of Project Settings > DreamShader Custom Pass > Layer Names. Every primitive component of\nthe actor receives them, or -- with All Primitives off -- only those that carry Component Tag. The layers are added\nto whatever else gives a primitive layers, and taken away again when this component is unregistered, so two layer\ncomponents can share an actor; they should not share a layer.\n\nThe primitives are gathered when the component registers and when Refresh is called: one added to the actor later\ngets its layers from a Refresh."
}

DreamPassLayerComponent:bAllPrimitives {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassLayerComponent.h#DreamPassLayerComponent:bAllPrimitives
    src   "Every primitive component of the actor. Off: only those with Component Tag."
}

DreamPassLayerComponent:ComponentTag {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassLayerComponent.h#DreamPassLayerComponent:ComponentTag
    src   "With All Primitives off, the component tag a primitive needs to receive the layers. None selects no primitive."
}

DreamPassLayerComponent:GetLayerNameOptions {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassLayerComponent.h#DreamPassLayerComponent:GetLayerNameOptions
    src   "The details panel's choices for Layers."
}

DreamPassLayerComponent:Layers {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassLayerComponent.h#DreamPassLayerComponent:Layers
    src   "The pass layers the primitives are in: names from the project settings' Layer Names."
}

DreamPassLayerComponent:Refresh {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassLayerComponent.h#DreamPassLayerComponent:Refresh
    src   "Gathers the actor's primitives again and gives them the layers: after a primitive was added or a tag changed."
}

DreamPassLayerComponent:SetLayers {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassLayerComponent.h#DreamPassLayerComponent:SetLayers
    src   "Replaces the layers and applies them at once."
}